  "title": "Nutty Tunisian Tomato Tagine",
  "description": "A grassy, gooey, one-pot Tunisian dish featuring tomato puree and plant-based friendly ingredients, this tagine is perfect for a weeknight dinner. It combines the flavors of Africa and the Middle East with a nutty twist.",
