  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the tomato puree, sliced almonds, uncooked khao khuat rice, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 25 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from the heat and let it cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with additional sliced almonds if desired."
